         startHelpText = "Get collecting!";
         Time = "105000";
         trivia = "Level created on March 19, 2026\nFabrication:\nMarch 19, 2026 - Built pool deck out of purple platforms and added water in pool. Also added moving platform and physics trigger to get up to upper level (not really built yet).\nMarch 20, 2026 - Added more to upper level including trapdoors, super jumps, and high donut, and added 9 gems on the donut. Also added 3 spawn triggers and deleted start pad. Added gems in the pool, and added a gravity wall with mines and gems on it.\nMarch 21, 2026 - Added nest egg.\nMay 5, 2026 - Added some gems on pathways on upper layer.\nMay 7, 2026 - Added gems on pool deck and added a second moving platform on upper layer with gems on its path. Started the cannon section, but still was troubleshooting some things. Then I got it sort of figured out. Still no gems in that sector.\nMay 9, 2026 - Added shock absorber triggers and all gems to the cannon section, and added bounds.\nUpdates:\nSeptember 25, 2026 - Added camera path, icon picture, challenge scores, hints, and trivia.\nTrivia:\nThis level is really cool. I used it to figure out how to make water physics triggers, physics triggers, spawn triggers, cannons, and other smaller things in a big ol\' multi-faceted gem hunt challenge platform.";
         type = "Custom";
         ultimateHint = "Traverse the level quickly and make use of the few powerups and elements at your disposal.";
